<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Delta Financial started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Delta Financial started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities analyst Jennifer Scutti started coverage of Delta Financial Corp Friday with a rating of buy, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Woodbury, N.Y., company opened up 5/8 at 17-1/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
